---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import CallToAction from '../components/CallToAction.astro';
import joyImage from '../assets/people/joy-professional-wide.jpg';
import paulImage from '../assets/people/paul-portrait.jpg';
import { organizationSchema, websiteSchema, joySchema, pageSchema, paulSchema } from '../data/schema';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Joy & Paul | Threads Coaching" description="Meet Joy and Paul: warm, experienced guides for life, leadership and faith-aware coaching." path="/about" schema={[organizationSchema, websiteSchema, joySchema, paulSchema, pageSchema('AboutPage', '/about', 'About Joy and Paul')] }>
  <div class="container"><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'About' }]} /></div>
    <section class="section hero-copy"><div class="container narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Meet your coaches</p><h1>Two different approaches. One shared heart for helping people grow.</h1><p class="lead">We are Joy and Paul, a husband-and-wife team. We each bring our own experience and coaching style, while sharing a Christian vision of people growing in courage, clarity, purpose and wholeness.</p></div></section>
    <section class="section"><div class="container split split--media"><div><Image src={joyImage} alt="Joy Blundell" width={640} densities={[1, 1.5]} sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 45vw, 100vw" quality={60} /></div><div><p class="eyebrow">I’m Joy</p><h2>I help people lead change without losing sight of who they are.</h2><p>I am a qualified Life and Leadership Coach, pastor, organisational leader and speaker. I first experienced the power of coaching when I hit turbulent moments in my own leadership. It helped me process difficult situations, grow in confidence and find greater clarity about my calling.</p><p>I trained with Ride the Wave professional coach training in 2020 and have since gained more than 700 hours of coaching experience. Alongside coaching, I have founded Acts Trust, formed GLX and co-created Transform Lincoln, experiences that shape how I work with leaders, teams and organisations seeking meaningful change.</p><ul class="credentials-list"><li>Qualified Life &amp; Leadership Coach</li><li>700+ coaching hours</li><li>Pastor &amp; organisational leader</li></ul></div></div></section>
    <section class="section section--tint"><div class="container split split--media"><div><Image src={paulImage} alt="Paul Blundell" width={640} densities={[1, 1.5]} sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 45vw, 100vw" quality={54} /></div><div><p class="eyebrow">I’m Paul</p><h2>I help people pursue identity, purpose and wholeness with God at the centre.</h2><p>I am a pastor and coach, and I am passionate about people knowing God and living from their identity as image bearers. My coaching grows out of my own journey of healing and breakthrough across body, mind and spirit.</p><p>I am currently training in Breakthrough Life Coaching. I bring a pastoral, faith-filled approach that can include powerful questions, inner-healing tools, prayer and practical goal setting. My aim is not simply the absence of struggle, but a deeper experience of shalom, peace, purpose and alignment.</p><ul class="credentials-list"><li>Pastor &amp; teacher</li><li>Breakthrough Life Coaching training</li><li>Body, soul &amp; spirit focus</li></ul></div></div></section>
    <section class="section"><div class="container narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Our approach</p><h2>We won’t hand you a formula for somebody else’s life.</h2><p>We believe good coaching helps you pay attention to who you are, what God may be inviting you into, what is getting in the way and what a faithful next step looks like. Our styles are different, but our aim is the same: honest conversation that leads to meaningful change.</p><ul><li><strong>Clarity without prescription.</strong> We ask questions that help you think, notice and decide rather than telling you who to become.</li><li><strong>Faith without compartmentalising.</strong> Where it fits you, prayer, spiritual reflection and Christian identity can be part of the conversation.</li><li><strong>Reflection that becomes action.</strong> Insight matters, but we also help you turn it into practical goals, experiments and next steps.</li></ul></div></section>
    <CallToAction title="Want to find the right starting point?" body="Explore the coaching options or tell us a little about what you are facing." primaryHref="/contact" primaryLabel="Start a conversation" />
</BaseLayout>
